{
  "key": 54359,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_SpeechWasBigLie",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Did you enjoy my speech? It\n",
        "was effective if I do say so\r",
        "myself.\r",
        "My subordinates are all fools.\n",
        "None of them understand my vision.\r",
        "But you might, you have used your\n",
        "Pokémon as tools to reach this\r",
        "point.\r",
        "You have left behind those who\n",
        "could not help you in your goals.\r",
        "In many ways I sense you are a\n",
        "kindred spirit of mine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_IKnowWhyYoureHere",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re here for UXIE, MESPRIT, and\n",
        "AZELF, correct? You want to save\r",
        "them...\r",
        "I no longer have any need for\n",
        "them. Go right ahead. I couldn’t\r",
        "care less.\r",
        "Do you save them out of pity?\r",
        "Maybe you don’t know yourself...\r",
        "Perhaps saving them is merely a\n",
        "stepping stone towards your\r",
        "goals...\r",
        "It’s been a long time since I felt\n",
        "such emotions.\r",
        "When I was a child, I used to play\n",
        "at Lake Verity. One day, I\r",
        "witnessed the legendary Pokémon\n",
        "crying.\r",
        "I felt a deep sense of sorrow for\n",
        "it. I showed compassion towards\r",
        "the legendary Pokémon. I tried to\n",
        "comfort it.\r",
        "That was a mistake.\r",
        "I could sense something was wrong\n",
        "when I touched it. I didn’t\r",
        "understand what at first. Several\n",
        "days later I understood the truth.\r",
        "My emotions were gone.\r",
        "I could no longer feel happy or\n",
        "sad. I could no longer love or\r",
        "know what it is to be loved. All\n",
        "that was left was one singular\r",
        "emotion...\r",
        "Melancholy.\r",
        "I have carried this melancholy\n",
        "with me ever since. It is this\r",
        "emotion that drives me to what I\n",
        "do. It allowed me to see all that\r",
        "is rotten in the world. It allowed\n",
        "me to see the beauty in Oblivion.\r",
        "Oblivion is a world without joy or\n",
        "suffering.\r",
        "Oblivion is a world without hope\n",
        "or despair.\r",
        "Oblivion is a world without love\n",
        "or hate.\r",
        "With GIRATINA’s power, I will\n",
        "access the Distortion World. The\r",
        "negative world that exists\n",
        "inverted to our own.\r",
        "When matter and anti-matter\n",
        "collide they annihilate.\r",
        "Do you understand now?\r",
        "Perhaps if I win you’ll\n",
        "understand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_YouAreIndeedStrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I see.\n",
        "You are indeed strong.\r",
        "You have used your tools well.\r",
        "You would be a great asset to Team\n",
        "Galactic.\r",
        "I’ll reward you for your efforts.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_IMakePowerMyOwn",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The Master Ball is the\n",
        "ultimate Poké Ball.\r",
        "It will unfailingly catch any\n",
        "Pokémon in the wild.\r",
        "I have my own. This is merely\n",
        "a spare.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_TakeWarpPanel",
      "en_US": [
        "Your victory changes nothing I’m\n",
        "afraid.\r",
        "The one I trust above all others\n",
        "assured me I would succeed.\r",
        "If you wish to save the Pokémon\n",
        "from the lakes, take the warp\r",
        "panel ahead.\r",
        "I am off to Mt. Coronet.\r",
        "I will ascend the mountain to its\n",
        "peak where destiny awaits me.\r",
        "It is there that I will create my\n",
        "new world of Oblivion.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_DoorIsLocked",
      "en_US": [
        "The door is locked.\n",
        "A special key is needed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_UseGalacticKey",
      "en_US": [
        "The door is locked.\n",
        "A special key is needed.\r",
        "Use the Galactic Key?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_DoorOpened",
      "en_US": "The door opened."
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_TeamGalacticWarpPanels",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic Warp Panels!\r",
        "The green warp panel returns you\n",
        "to the ground floor.\r",
        "Onward to a new universe!\n",
        "-Team Galactic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_TeamGalacticReport",
      "en_US": "Team Galactic Report\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_ReadWhichReport",
      "en_US": [
        "Which report would you like to\n",
        "read?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_ReportCreationOfSpace",
      "en_US": [
        "Some say the universe originated\n",
        "from a massive explosion.\r",
        "Similarly, Sinnoh is thought to\n",
        "have been formed by an explosion\r",
        "in\f",
        "ancient times.\r",
        "Needless to say, the explosion\n",
        "came from the power of a Pokémon.\r",
        "The Pokémon must have been the\n",
        "mythical creature considered\f",
        "a deity by the ancients.\r",
        "Our aim is not to capture the\n",
        "mythical Pokémon, but to obtain\r",
        "its power...\r",
        "The PC entry ends there...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_ReportMythicalPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "The mythical Pokémon...\r",
        "According to myths, the Pokémon\n",
        "created Sinnoh with its power.\r",
        "However, capturing the Pokémon\n",
        "with a Poké Ball prevents it from\r",
        "using\f",
        "its full power...\r",
        "But with the Red Chain, the\n",
        "Pokémon can be shackled, and its\r",
        "power can\f",
        "be used without restraint...\r",
        "The PC entry ends there...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ4F_Text_ReportRedChain",
      "en_US": [
        "The Red Chain...\r",
        "The Pokémon of the three lakes and\n",
        "Mt. Coronet are somehow connected.\r",
        "Capturing the Pokémon of the lakes\n",
        "will free the Pokémon of Mt.\r",
        "Coronet.\r",
        "From the Pokémon of the lakes,\n",
        "crystals can be extracted to\r",
        "create\f",
        "a Red Chain.\r",
        "Using that Red Chain, the mythical\n",
        "Pokémon can be summoned and\r",
        "shackled\f",
        "to do as we command...\r",
        "The PC entry ends there...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
